    "structure": "The advantage decays with depth -- largest at block 0, smallest at block 49 -- while the absolute error grows with depth. So fp16 helps least exactly where the kernel is least accurate. Block 49 is also where cosine drops off a cliff for both modes, which is consistent with this repo's existing note that block 49 is the counterexample.",
