    "This is KERNEL fidelity, not perceptual quality. A rel_l2 ratio and a visible difference share a denominator with nothing -- the unit trap `docs/SOLATTN.md` names.",
    "Captures are 362 frames at 1024x768 with 3 references, Sol-free. Sol-free is established mechanically: `h3_capture.py` indexes steps by sage-forward entries and Sol would cap that at 4 with the shipped window, yet _s8 and _s14 exist.",
    "256 rows per capture, sampled in even strata across the packed sequence. Segment boundaries are not recorded in the capture, so rows are positional, not per-segment.",
